{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_2001_p", "source_sha256": "750c754522997c43ec7d560776cf999e482f240e204b9981a868f278bcbb8829", "ja": "今日の収録は、アイドルがお弁当を作る、\nっていう企画だけど……やよい、準備はいいか？", "zh": "今天的节目企划是由偶像制作便当……\n弥生，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_2002_005yay", "source_sha256": "51f5fab9200b6c1b22b7f2cb2bfba478ccd36d695d0a4c9dc6208616ac1a5189", "ja": "えへへっ、任せてください！　お弁当なら、\n妹や弟達のをいつも作ってますから、バッチリです～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，请交给我吧！\n我经常帮弟弟妹妹做便当，所以准备很万全～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "670300fa8bad0ae62678ee4bd43a836cca4948c4821b480b4dfb8a7d497a92c4", "ja": "ふわふわのたまご焼きに、タコさんウィンナーに、\n海苔をちょきんちょきんって切ったりして～。", "zh": "松松软软的煎蛋卷配上章鱼小香肠，\n再把海苔切得碎碎的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_2004_p", "source_sha256": "743408224293ad598ba2d7705329c276cc1eac4fbe6b4ae7f56a12065f293c6a", "ja": "っと、収録が始まるみたいだな。\n詳しい説明は、番組内で頼む！", "zh": "啊，好像要开始录影了。\n详细内容就在节目上说明吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_2005_005yay", "source_sha256": "ea8cf27dff3955fdd1d0b15d962312e22dcc97440e603914d1180c76c4682eea", "ja": "あ、はーい、いってきまーっす！", "zh": "啊，好～我上场了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_2006_p", "source_sha256": "ca421a0e744a1464e72648f63a47fd95c3c145e1402fa1ed0b333bc4a7604df6", "ja": "（やよいはテキパキと、楽しそうにお弁当を完成させて\n拍手喝采をあびた。まるで小さなお母さんだな！）", "zh": "（弥生手脚俐落，开开心心地完成了便当，\n博得众人喝采。简直就像是个小妈妈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
